# ============================================================
# Betikler - kaynak ve belgeler izlenir; calisma zamani yapilari disarida / source and docs tracked; runtime artifacts stay out
# ============================================================

# 1. IDE AYARLARI / IDE SETTINGS
# [EN] Local editor state, never shared.
# [TR] Yerel duzenleyici durumu, paylasilmaz.
.idea/

# 2. KISAYOLLAR / SHORTCUTS
# [EN] Generated locally per machine; targets are absolute paths.
# [TR] Makine basina uretilir; hedefler mutlak yoldur.
Shortcuts/
*.lnk

# 3. LOGLAR / LOGS
# [EN] Runtime output stays out entirely; each script recreates its folder.
# [TR] Calisma ciktisi tamamen disarida kalir; her betik klasorunu kendi acar.
Logs/

# 4. GECICI DOSYALAR / TEMP FILES
# [EN] Script scratch files.
# [TR] Betik gecici dosyalari.
*.tmp
*.zip

# 5. YANSIMALAR / MIRRORS
# [EN] Local Turkish mirror of AGENTS.md; human review only, never committed.
# [TR] AGENTS.md'nin yerel Turkce yansimasi; yalnizca insan denetimi icin, asla commit edilmez.
AGENTS-TR.md
